WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.840
When a reply has several results, a status
label helps you see where to look first.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.472
The agent runs the greeting test
and reports where it passed.

3
00:00:11.472 --> 00:00:15.276
The next label calls out the
hosted checks it hasn’t run.

4
00:00:15.276 --> 00:00:18.280
Emphasis draws those
words as coloured pills.

5
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.596
Read the label and then the named check.

6
00:00:27.596 --> 00:00:31.340
That tells you what happened
and where the result came from.
